WEBVTT

02:13.760 --> 02:16.320
CANGYUE TOWER

02:18.840 --> 02:19.800
Who are you?

02:21.760 --> 02:22.720
Strange.

02:22.800 --> 02:24.320
Yan Fengshan shouldn't be here this early.

02:27.840 --> 02:29.040
I'm a cripple.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.520
Who do you think I am?

02:49.280 --> 02:53.600
I, Gu Yu, request to see
the regional commanders

02:54.240 --> 02:57.440
of Long'an, Beiting, Fanyang, and Zhenxi.

03:16.320 --> 03:20.560
Yan Fengshan abducted me to win you over.

03:20.640 --> 03:22.960
But as you can see now,

03:23.560 --> 03:28.080
the Huben Army could not even
hold a cripple like me.

03:28.800 --> 03:33.760
That alone proves
Yan Fengshan's strength is spent.

03:38.800 --> 03:41.480
I came unarmed to see you.

03:42.920 --> 03:44.880
I do not fear death.

03:46.400 --> 03:50.360
I only fear becoming
the shame of Chang'an.

03:51.640 --> 03:52.920
Before you all,

03:54.080 --> 03:55.600
I will speak plainly.

03:56.240 --> 03:59.960
I have handed the command
of the Baiwenhu Army to His Majesty.

04:00.800 --> 04:04.960
If you refuse to surrender
your military seals,

04:06.000 --> 04:07.600
that is rebellion.

04:19.000 --> 04:21.800
You may kill me right here.

04:25.640 --> 04:30.960
But whether I live or die today,

04:33.000 --> 04:34.520
my troops

04:36.040 --> 04:38.760
will march with His Majesty
to quell the rebellion.

04:43.400 --> 04:46.400
The Tiemo people hate His Majesty and me

04:46.480 --> 04:51.040
because when we join hands
on the battlefield,

04:51.120 --> 04:54.680
we are not only strong but also ruthless.

05:01.240 --> 05:04.520
Yan Fengshan had
the Baiwenhu Army ambushed.

05:07.360 --> 05:09.080
Pangtou,

05:11.120 --> 05:12.400
Qi,

05:13.440 --> 05:14.520
Wei,

05:15.480 --> 05:16.760
and Shan were all killed.

05:21.960 --> 05:26.480
So, in return, I left him a mountain
of corpses in Hidden Soldier Alley.

05:32.720 --> 05:34.800
If you choose treason,

05:38.680 --> 05:41.800
I will make sure you watch
with your own eyes

05:42.680 --> 05:46.480
as every grown man
in your households is killed,

05:47.240 --> 05:50.440
every woman exiled,

05:50.520 --> 05:54.520
and every part of your garrisons
reduced to wasteland.

05:56.600 --> 05:58.080
I, Gu Yu,

06:00.440 --> 06:01.680
always…

06:04.720 --> 06:06.120
keep my word.

06:17.840 --> 06:21.320
CANGYUE TOWER

06:26.560 --> 06:31.080
For now, at least,
the imperial court has avoided disaster.

06:34.760 --> 06:38.040
Next, everything rests
on whether Huai'an's trap

06:38.760 --> 06:41.360
can have Yan Fengshan killed.

07:09.880 --> 07:11.440
Mother, it's all set.

07:14.360 --> 07:16.400
Once I'm done, put this one in too.

07:50.320 --> 07:53.320
I searched everywhere for you.
I thought something had happened.

08:00.240 --> 08:04.080
Those who should be dead are still alive.
I won't die yet.

08:09.520 --> 08:10.720
How did it go?

08:10.800 --> 08:11.720
Just as you ordered,

08:11.800 --> 08:13.680
the Imperial Guards have shut
nine of the twelve gates.

08:13.760 --> 08:15.360
Only the three western gates remain open.

08:15.440 --> 08:18.840
They also pushed
the inspection posts five li outward.

08:18.920 --> 08:20.240
The forged travel pass has surfaced.

08:20.320 --> 08:23.240
After passing inspection,
he entered through Yanping Gate.

08:25.520 --> 08:26.760
How about the deployment?

08:26.840 --> 08:28.440
Six full battalions are in place.

08:29.360 --> 08:32.159
Xiao Wuyang has set out as well,
carrying that sword of his.

08:51.120 --> 08:52.440
The rain

08:54.200 --> 08:56.160
sounds different from usual.

08:58.480 --> 09:01.040
Huai'an, you must've been too tired.

09:05.880 --> 09:06.920
Maybe.

09:09.280 --> 09:13.440
I've waited too long for this moment.

09:36.280 --> 09:38.160
Greetings, Your Majesty.

09:44.480 --> 09:48.440
Five li outside the city, the one
carrying the travel pass you forged

09:49.040 --> 09:52.480
was dressed in white, wearing a bamboo hat
with black gauze hanging from it.

09:52.560 --> 09:55.840
It was confirmed.
That man was Yan Fengshan.

09:55.920 --> 09:57.960
Our men kept a close watch on him.

09:58.560 --> 10:00.640
There were seven people with him,

10:00.720 --> 10:03.040
all keeping a careful distance.

10:04.840 --> 10:06.560
Once he enters the city,
the signal flag goes up,

10:07.160 --> 10:08.600
and we will strike on the spot.

10:09.360 --> 10:12.480
But he is Yan Fengshan.
Will he really come?

10:16.160 --> 10:17.960
He is Yan Fengshan.

10:18.680 --> 10:20.240
Will he come?

10:53.920 --> 10:55.280
FLATBREAD, SESAME SOUP

10:55.360 --> 10:56.800
BARLEY PORRIDGE, NOODLE SOUP

10:56.880 --> 10:58.080
MEAT PIES, PEPPER SOUP, FRIED BREAD

12:59.320 --> 13:03.560
Your Majesty, General Gu,
Mr. Xie Huai'an, it's done.

13:04.280 --> 13:06.400
Have you confirmed it was Yan Fengshan?

13:07.000 --> 13:07.920
We are examining the body.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.640
We found this on the horse.

14:01.960 --> 14:03.680
LI'S TAVERN

16:37.440 --> 16:38.600
Let me.

16:46.960 --> 16:48.080
Give it to me.

17:04.880 --> 17:06.560
She shed many tears.

17:17.040 --> 17:17.880
General.

17:22.040 --> 17:23.119
ROSTER OF TROOP ROTATIONS

17:23.200 --> 17:24.400
LUO SHENG, ZHU SANCAI, YUCHI ZHONG

17:24.480 --> 17:25.400
ZHANG BINGCHEN, XIAO ANFU, GAO CHANGFENG

17:32.280 --> 17:33.160
Huai'an.

17:41.160 --> 17:44.920
This is the list of everyone
involved in this operation.

17:47.120 --> 17:48.560
It is time to face it.

17:58.520 --> 18:00.160
Five li outside the city,

18:00.760 --> 18:02.200
the man who passed inspection
was Yan Fengshan.

18:02.960 --> 18:06.480
But somewhere along the way,
Bai Wan was switched in.

18:07.520 --> 18:11.360
That means we had long been exposed,

18:13.200 --> 18:14.840
and the men outside the city

18:15.600 --> 18:17.800
had long been infiltrated
by Huben members.

18:19.560 --> 18:21.520
The three signal officers on the towers

18:22.200 --> 18:24.080
knew it wasn't Yan Fengshan,

18:24.160 --> 18:26.080
yet they raised the flags anyway,

18:26.840 --> 18:30.280
because they, too, were Huben members.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.120
It is not hard to identify these people,

18:34.200 --> 18:37.040
but the key still lies
in Hidden Soldier Alley.

18:42.440 --> 18:44.800
General, Hidden Soldier Alley is empty.

18:47.920 --> 18:50.120
Does it have another exit?

18:50.200 --> 18:53.440
Residents of an entire ward,
thousands of people, have vanished.

18:53.520 --> 18:55.000
There must be another way out.

18:55.080 --> 18:56.920
It no longer matters.

18:57.000 --> 19:00.000
What matters is
that Yan Fengshan has returned.

19:01.400 --> 19:03.920
And with all the Huben guards
from Hidden Soldier Alley,

19:04.560 --> 19:06.440
if he rallies them,

19:06.520 --> 19:10.160
who do you think
he would want to strike at the most?

19:11.080 --> 19:12.240
I should return to the palace.

19:13.880 --> 19:15.000
Xiao Wuyang?

19:54.600 --> 19:57.800
The greatest enemy
of our lives has appeared.

19:59.840 --> 20:01.480
You may stay grieving,

20:02.480 --> 20:04.760
but I am going to the palace
to support His Majesty.

20:05.520 --> 20:09.720
If I die, I owe you one life
for Hidden Soldier Alley.

20:10.760 --> 20:13.560
I will repay it in the next life.

20:20.080 --> 20:21.480
With Yan Fengshan back,

20:23.680 --> 20:25.960
I am prepared to lose Chang'an,

20:27.600 --> 20:32.040
but I have never prepared
for Chang'an to lose Gu Yu.

20:40.360 --> 20:41.600
You cannot die.

20:44.200 --> 20:48.880
Then I hope that when we meet again,

20:50.360 --> 20:55.680
I will see a Xie Huai'an
who has stood back up.

20:58.080 --> 20:59.120
You will.

21:07.840 --> 21:10.440
-Baiwenhu soldiers, hear my command!
-Yes!

21:10.520 --> 21:11.560
Follow me to the palace!

21:37.280 --> 21:38.120
Protect His Majesty!

24:14.000 --> 24:17.680
At most two hours from now,
the city will fall into chaos.

24:18.320 --> 24:19.640
You should leave.

24:20.600 --> 24:22.440
I never told her the whole truth.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.880
I owed her too much.

24:26.360 --> 24:27.440
At the very least,

24:28.240 --> 24:32.480
I should see her off as family.

24:38.160 --> 24:39.440
Don't worry.

24:40.640 --> 24:43.640
I know every skill the Huben guards use.

24:44.840 --> 24:46.120
They cannot kill me.

24:50.160 --> 24:51.880
What happened to her

24:53.920 --> 24:56.040
matters deeply to me.

24:57.280 --> 24:59.040
It matters to us too.

24:59.800 --> 25:01.040
Huai'an, don't worry.

25:02.320 --> 25:04.920
I will keep him safe.

25:05.520 --> 25:07.720
I will not let him
fall into Yan Fengshan's hands.

25:09.080 --> 25:10.560
Go do what you must.

25:25.720 --> 25:26.960
Thank you.

25:28.840 --> 25:30.160
Now go.

25:36.080 --> 25:37.040
Use it for protection.

25:40.320 --> 25:43.520
Huai'an, your white hair
draws too much attention.

25:44.160 --> 25:48.000
When you go out,
wear a bamboo hat to cover it.

25:49.560 --> 25:52.720
Huai'an, you will come find us, right?

25:53.600 --> 25:56.080
Do not face Yan Fengshan alone.

25:56.720 --> 25:58.000
When the time comes to kill him,

26:00.560 --> 26:01.520
take us with you.

26:01.600 --> 26:03.880
I have not finished this road yet.

26:05.000 --> 26:08.280
Of course I'll need you both.

26:19.840 --> 26:23.200
There was a scholar named Han Ziling.

26:23.840 --> 26:27.360
He asked me to give you this letter.

26:28.440 --> 26:31.080
He said he had long admired you.

26:31.760 --> 26:33.800
If anything happens to me,

26:35.480 --> 26:38.600
please give this to him.

26:42.920 --> 26:44.000
Remember:

26:45.160 --> 26:49.480
do not fail the hopes
of the scholars of this realm.

26:52.280 --> 26:53.320
Live.

26:56.840 --> 26:57.720
I will.

27:03.360 --> 27:04.600
Now go.

28:06.200 --> 28:07.880
Why did you return to Chang'an?

28:11.360 --> 28:12.960
It was my fault.

28:22.440 --> 28:24.200
It was my fault.

28:27.240 --> 28:29.040
It was my fault.

28:42.400 --> 28:44.560
Humans belong to heaven and earth.

28:45.480 --> 28:47.160
Our souls come from the clouds,

28:47.880 --> 28:49.840
our bodies return to the earth.

28:52.600 --> 28:55.480
Heaven and Earth leave traces
upon a person,

28:58.840 --> 29:00.280
and those traces can guide one back

29:02.080 --> 29:03.720
to where they once walked.

29:49.080 --> 29:51.080
Mother, I did something bad!

29:54.520 --> 29:55.720
Miss.

29:57.200 --> 29:58.040
Oh, dear.

29:58.120 --> 30:00.080
I'm so sorry, truly sorry.

30:00.160 --> 30:01.920
-Look at what you did.
-It's all right.

30:02.000 --> 30:04.160
He didn't do it on purpose.
I simply happened to pass by.

30:05.280 --> 30:06.560
Miss, I'm really sorry.

30:07.400 --> 30:10.360
Why don't you come in
and change into something clean?

30:10.440 --> 30:12.920
We have new clothes, all clean.

30:13.000 --> 30:14.680
They should fit you well.

30:14.760 --> 30:16.080
It's fine.

30:16.160 --> 30:18.320
I insist. It was my son's fault.

30:18.400 --> 30:20.720
With your clothes dirty,
you must be uncomfortable.

30:20.800 --> 30:21.880
-Come on.
-Thank you.

30:24.320 --> 30:25.920
We don't have much food to offer.

30:26.520 --> 30:27.520
Please make do.

30:27.600 --> 30:30.280
I've been living on cold,
plain food along the way.

30:30.360 --> 30:32.200
A bowl of hot noodles
is more than wonderful.

30:34.840 --> 30:36.320
What is he doing at the door?

30:37.400 --> 30:39.320
He is waiting for his father.

30:39.400 --> 30:42.240
His father works as
a ferryman in Nanwei Trough,

30:42.320 --> 30:44.320
30 or 40 li from here.

30:44.400 --> 30:45.920
It's not easy for him to come back,

30:46.640 --> 30:48.800
but whenever he can
find someone to take his place,

30:49.480 --> 30:51.680
even if it means
walking a whole day and night,

30:51.760 --> 30:53.360
he'll come home to visit.

30:54.120 --> 30:57.880
Some spend their whole lives walking,
only to reach home.

30:59.520 --> 31:00.800
You too, miss?

31:04.800 --> 31:08.240
I've lived in Chang'an for years.
Now I miss home.

31:09.280 --> 31:12.880
Your father and mother
must be longing for you too.

31:14.400 --> 31:17.400
To be missed by family is a blessing.

31:20.120 --> 31:21.840
I think I've heard that…

31:23.320 --> 31:27.000
My husband once said
he had a ferryman companion.

31:27.080 --> 31:30.280
The man said he fled
to Nanwei Trough with his little sister.

31:30.360 --> 31:34.520
Then his sister was taken in by a family,

31:34.600 --> 31:36.480
and he stayed behind,

31:37.000 --> 31:39.240
working as a ferryman
while watching over her.

31:40.120 --> 31:42.080
He kept watch for seven whole years.

31:44.080 --> 31:46.400
I don't know what disaster
struck their family.

31:46.480 --> 31:49.400
His sister was right beside him,
yet they couldn't reunite.

31:49.480 --> 31:51.400
How bitter that must have been.

31:51.920 --> 31:53.720
That man also told my husband

31:53.800 --> 31:56.880
that having someone to worry about
was a kind of blessing,

31:56.960 --> 31:58.040
just like you said.

32:04.480 --> 32:08.000
Is that ferryman still in Nanwei Trough?

32:09.840 --> 32:11.000
No.

32:11.080 --> 32:13.560
My husband said something happened,
and he left.

32:14.760 --> 32:16.320
Let me light a lamp for my husband,

32:16.400 --> 32:20.120
so he knows my son and I
are thinking of him.

32:52.280 --> 32:53.280
Sir.

32:54.400 --> 32:57.760
Miss, are you here to offer incense
or seeking a divination?

32:59.520 --> 33:01.520
I came to ask for a naming slip.

33:03.360 --> 33:05.600
Has a child been born at home?

33:05.680 --> 33:06.720
Congratulations.

33:07.640 --> 33:09.000
Is it a boy or a girl?

33:10.360 --> 33:11.280
Please, have a seat.

33:16.880 --> 33:19.560
It's not for a child. It's for myself.

33:21.480 --> 33:24.560
No one asks for a naming slip at your age.

33:28.040 --> 33:29.920
My family suffered a disaster
when I was little.

33:30.760 --> 33:33.080
I was separated from a family member
for many years.

33:34.640 --> 33:36.240
Recently, I found him again.

33:36.840 --> 33:39.720
This naming slip
is to reclaim my true name

33:39.800 --> 33:40.880
and restore my ties with him.

33:45.760 --> 33:50.280
To spend half a lifetime adrift
and still find your family again

33:51.640 --> 33:52.760
is no easy thing.

33:54.480 --> 33:58.600
Fate parts people
but also brings them back together.

34:03.920 --> 34:06.400
So, for this naming slip, I will write…

34:08.639 --> 34:11.719
Do you still remember your name
after all these years?

34:14.199 --> 34:15.320
My family name is Liu.

34:17.000 --> 34:20.520
I've carried this amulet
for as long as I can remember.

34:21.440 --> 34:23.159
I never understood the meaning,

34:24.159 --> 34:25.360
but now I finally do.

34:28.960 --> 34:30.560
My given name is written on it.

34:31.239 --> 34:33.719
A single character: Li.

34:41.800 --> 34:45.920
Then for the blessing, I will write,

34:47.400 --> 34:50.920
"May you find home again
and know lasting peace."

34:51.000 --> 34:52.400
How does that sound?

34:53.920 --> 34:54.840
Thank you, sir.

35:01.520 --> 35:05.920
LIU LI: MAY YOU FIND HOME AGAIN
AND KNOW LASTING PEACE.

35:13.080 --> 35:14.840
LIU LI

35:21.720 --> 35:23.920
BAI WAN

35:24.000 --> 35:26.320
LIU LI

35:33.040 --> 35:34.040
Liu Li,

35:35.880 --> 35:36.920
so you

35:40.320 --> 35:42.680
came back to reunite with me?

36:37.120 --> 36:39.080
-Take care.
-Goodbye.

36:39.720 --> 36:43.560
CHEN ZHIYING OF THE HUBEN ARMY

37:08.960 --> 37:10.360
Can you promise that?

37:11.840 --> 37:12.880
Of course I can.

37:12.960 --> 37:16.200
Then will you write to me
to tell me you're safe?

37:16.280 --> 37:19.480
Wherever you go, write to me every year,

37:20.360 --> 37:23.360
so I know you're safe.

37:24.480 --> 37:28.000
She's your sister,
yet you let her join another family.

37:28.680 --> 37:32.200
You've been a ferryman here
for seven years, three li from her home,

37:32.920 --> 37:34.440
just to protect her from afar.

37:35.320 --> 37:36.640
How long can you keep this up?

37:37.720 --> 37:38.880
I don't know.

37:40.640 --> 37:44.760
I only hope she never remembers her past.

37:59.520 --> 38:02.840
That night, I hid behind the wall

38:03.480 --> 38:05.760
and saw someone feeding you soup.

38:06.640 --> 38:10.400
You were surrounded by people

38:11.880 --> 38:13.000
who cared for you.

38:14.120 --> 38:18.560
At that moment,
I decided to leave you with that family.

38:19.560 --> 38:23.960
I thought that if I was careful enough,

38:25.360 --> 38:27.440
you would live a safe life.

38:33.400 --> 38:34.400
Liu Li,

38:37.080 --> 38:39.160
I was wrong.

38:41.160 --> 38:45.120
When the time comes, I will reunite
with you, Father, and Mother.

38:46.480 --> 38:48.040
The four of us

38:50.800 --> 38:51.960
will be together again.

39:07.040 --> 39:12.920
INCENSE

39:23.240 --> 39:25.040
Is it a funeral?

39:28.040 --> 39:30.640
The whole city is under martial law,
with killings everywhere.

39:30.720 --> 39:33.520
Even the city gates
have changed hands several times.

39:33.600 --> 39:34.720
And you…

39:35.760 --> 39:38.040
You have to go through this
on the very day

39:38.120 --> 39:39.320
the court is thrown into chaos.

39:41.200 --> 39:42.760
Everyone suffers.

39:42.840 --> 39:44.880
Everyone suffers!

39:45.840 --> 39:47.560
Sir, please come in.

39:51.400 --> 39:52.720
Do you need a memorial tablet made?

39:59.040 --> 40:02.320
Who is it for? What should it say?

40:06.720 --> 40:07.720
It is…

40:09.520 --> 40:10.960
for my late sister, Liu Li.

40:19.880 --> 40:25.560
LATE SISTER LIU LI

41:07.600 --> 41:08.840
General Fengshan.

41:14.920 --> 41:18.800
YAN FENGSHAN

41:26.240 --> 41:28.160
In this courtyard,

41:28.960 --> 41:31.000
I can almost see the traces
of my old friends.

41:31.920 --> 41:34.360
When you have time,
ask around at the brokerages.

41:34.440 --> 41:37.320
If it can be bought, buy this place.

41:37.400 --> 41:39.720
It is a fine courtyard indeed.

41:39.800 --> 41:41.760
Even convenient for cooking.

41:42.720 --> 41:44.120
I will go to the brokers tomorrow.

41:48.160 --> 41:49.200
General…

42:33.520 --> 42:35.200
The Liu family's child is buried here.

42:36.440 --> 42:37.280
From this day on,

42:38.240 --> 42:40.200
no one is allowed
to set foot on this patch of land.

42:41.480 --> 42:42.320
Understood.

42:43.480 --> 42:46.360
General, we have taken the Imperial City.

42:46.440 --> 42:50.560
But the 400 men we first sent
to assassinate Xiao Wuyang were all lost.

42:51.600 --> 42:53.600
We found no trace of him.

42:58.600 --> 42:59.720
What about Gu Yu?

42:59.800 --> 43:03.040
Gu Yu led two 100-man Baiwenhu units
and tried to enter the Imperial City.

43:03.120 --> 43:04.480
We surrounded them.

43:04.560 --> 43:07.200
His men fought desperately
to break him out.

43:07.280 --> 43:08.400
By the time they reached Yongchang Ward,

43:08.480 --> 43:12.280
all the Baiwenhu soldiers had fallen,
and Gu Yu disappeared.

43:13.520 --> 43:16.040
Lock down the area
surrounding the Imperial City,

43:16.120 --> 43:17.800
west to Guangde Ward,
east to Xuanyang Ward,

43:18.400 --> 43:21.480
and south to the outer streets
of Jingzhao Prefecture.

43:22.080 --> 43:23.560
Both of them are injured.

43:23.640 --> 43:27.000
If they want to hide,
it can only be within this area.

43:27.760 --> 43:29.120
Find them.

43:29.960 --> 43:31.160
Understood.

43:35.240 --> 43:37.760
All 12 gates of Chang'an
are now under Huben guards' control.

43:38.840 --> 43:41.920
Xiao Wuyang stationed the Wuyang Army
30 li outside the city,

43:42.600 --> 43:44.160
but the armies

43:44.920 --> 43:47.080
of the four regional commanders
marched early on your order

43:47.680 --> 43:49.880
and have now arrived near Chang'an.

43:49.960 --> 43:52.200
Their forces outnumber the Wuyang Army
three to one

43:52.280 --> 43:53.400
and have kept them in check.

43:54.000 --> 43:57.000
Then that leaves only the north.

43:57.080 --> 43:58.920
Send a messenger to Tiemo

43:59.000 --> 44:00.960
and have them hold back
the main Baiwenhu forces.

44:01.040 --> 44:02.680
As long as they don't march south,

44:03.200 --> 44:05.280
Chang'an is ours.

44:05.360 --> 44:06.720
I will go.

44:06.800 --> 44:08.040
Zhiying will handle it.

44:08.800 --> 44:12.000
Wang Pu, you carry a criminal record.

44:12.080 --> 44:15.480
Now, where is White Hair?

44:19.320 --> 44:20.160
He hasn't been found.

44:43.360 --> 44:46.120
LATE SISTER LIU LI

45:29.240 --> 45:30.080
White Hair!

46:03.480 --> 46:04.920
Do you yield?

46:07.040 --> 46:08.200
I will return.

46:11.600 --> 46:13.400
And when I do, I will kill you.
